  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div data-hpc=\"true\" containertiming=\"hpc\"><article itemprop=\"text\"> <p dir=\"auto\">JumpServer is an open-source Privileged Access Management (PAM) platform that provides DevOps and IT teams with on-demand and secure access to SSH, RDP, Kubernetes, Database and RemoteApp endpoints through a web browser.</p>\n<themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture> <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/dcd9221310f5bee743ff306f6b89ca3f29fa8f2dcfe3f344efe6c6018e86a048/68747470733a2f2f7777772e6a756d707365727665722e636f6d2f696d616765732f6a756d707365727665722d617263682d6c696768742e706e67\" data-canonical-src=\"https://www.jumpserver.com/images/jumpserver-arch-light.png\"> <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e8d7619d3555986f07580d4e50e022876ce8c90baaf3e64b244e87e2ffd1876e/68747470733a2f2f7777772e6a756d707365727665722e636f6d2f696d616765732f6a756d707365727665722d617263682d6461726b2e706e67\" data-canonical-src=\"https://www.jumpserver.com/images/jumpserver-arch-dark.png\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dd612f3d-c958-4f84-b164-f31b75454d7f\" alt=\"Theme-based Image\">\n</picture></themed-picture>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Quickstart</h2><a id=\"user-content-quickstart\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Quickstart\" href=\"#quickstart\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Prepare a clean Linux Server ( 64 bit, &gt;= 4c8g )</p>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"curl -sSL https://github.com/jumpserver/jumpserver/releases/latest/download/quick_start.sh | bash\"><pre>curl -sSL https://github.com/jumpserver/jumpserver/releases/latest/download/quick_start.sh <span>|</span> bash</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Access JumpServer in your browser at <code>http://your-jumpserver-ip/</code></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Username: <code>admin</code></li>\n<li>Password: <code>ChangeMe</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlGYRbKrpgY\" title=\"JumpServer Quickstart\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/32935519/362229776-0f32f52b-9935-485e-8534-336c63389612.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..edeSlKzb0RSYUYicsvmaxptjftuVeRw4AFb1a3gP4ig\" alt=\"JumpServer Quickstart\" secured-asset-link=\"\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Screenshots</h2><a id=\"user-content-screenshots\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Screenshots\" href=\"#screenshots\"></a></p>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <markdown-accessiblity-table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Components</h2><a id=\"user-content-components\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Components\" href=\"#components\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">JumpServer consists of multiple key components, which collectively form the functional framework of JumpServer, providing users with comprehensive capabilities for operations management and security control.</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Project</th>\n<th>Status</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/lina\">Lina</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/lina/releases\"><img alt=\"Lina release\" src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/21455bf604dac454d6485c98fded3ac7130b5410760f5bd659196ed1c4e07a4f/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f72656c656173652f6a756d707365727665722f6c696e612e737667\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/release/jumpserver/lina.svg\"></a></td>\n<td>JumpServer Web UI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/luna\">Luna</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/luna/releases\"><img alt=\"Luna release\" src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/0e3d151a3ab3e133bfc1b211e51620c30f7adca03334db95f591a4ca05b2a90b/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f72656c656173652f6a756d707365727665722f6c756e612e737667\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/release/jumpserver/luna.svg\"></a></td>\n<td>JumpServer Web Terminal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/koko\">KoKo</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/koko/releases\"><img alt=\"Koko release\" src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/cd28903da9db2959823de013adf7963fe1b3a15cdb103509778fb5a1a1878084/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f72656c656173652f6a756d707365727665722f6b6f6b6f2e737667\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/release/jumpserver/koko.svg\"></a></td>\n<td>JumpServer Character Protocol Connector</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/lion\">Lion</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/lion/releases\"><img alt=\"Lion release\" src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/8d56569e8ef4743ae53f8bf35e4e28882a6d0d986a3d9b540d6b75f312d5f4f4/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f72656c656173652f6a756d707365727665722f6c696f6e2e737667\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/release/jumpserver/lion.svg\"></a></td>\n<td>JumpServer Graphical Protocol Connector</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/chen\">Chen</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/chen/releases\"><img alt=\"Chen release\" src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/790ec85152e07b3d82d181c4b27740c39a12f163ab0f4ddc1c204f5a0445b32d/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f72656c656173652f6a756d707365727665722f6368656e2e737667\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/release/jumpserver/chen.svg\"></a></td>\n<td>JumpServer Web DB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/clients\">Client</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/clients/releases\"><img alt=\"Clients release\" src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9d9cc3c3af270b82c94eac41fad4b4a56eed6bfa148a3b0c187b5bbe9875d352/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f72656c656173652f6a756d707365727665722f636c69656e74732e737667\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/release/jumpserver/clients.svg\"></a></td>\n<td>JumpServer Client</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/tinker\">Tinker</a></td>\n<td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/603c066d76e3c969969cefaab9c3e948b5bcb1dd857dd91fd68eebfe83d035c7/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f72656c656173652d707269766174652d726564\"><img alt=\"Tinker\" src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/603c066d76e3c969969cefaab9c3e948b5bcb1dd857dd91fd68eebfe83d035c7/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f72656c656173652d707269766174652d726564\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/release-private-red\"></a></td>\n<td>JumpServer Remote Application Connector (Windows)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/Panda\">Panda</a></td>\n<td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/603c066d76e3c969969cefaab9c3e948b5bcb1dd857dd91fd68eebfe83d035c7/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f72656c656173652d707269766174652d726564\"><img alt=\"Panda\" src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/603c066d76e3c969969cefaab9c3e948b5bcb1dd857dd91fd68eebfe83d035c7/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f72656c656173652d707269766174652d726564\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/release-private-red\"></a></td>\n<td>JumpServer EE Remote Application Connector (Linux)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jumpserver/razor\">Razor</a></td>\n<td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/603c066d76e3c969969cefaa